      "evidence_type": "surviving_burial_jade_and_museum_analysis",
      "source_notes": "Cicadas were used in several jade contexts; holes and archaeological placement help distinguish mouth jades from wearable ornaments. The accessory remains a fantasy reinterpretation.",
      "sources": [{"kind": "museum", "title": "Jade cicada mouth piece", "url": "https://www.chnmuseum.cn/zp/zpml/kgfjp/202104/t20210419_249838_wap.shtml"}]
